WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.200
Whoa! I'm a serpent with two heads.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.400
I'm carved from one piece of cedarwood.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.800
Maybe I was worn on the chest.

00:00:15.796 --> 00:00:18.596
I might have been worn by Huitzilopochtli's effigy.

00:00:19.296 --> 00:00:21.696
I was an emblem of authority.

00:00:25.296 --> 00:00:28.496
Now I'm on display in Room 27.
